    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earth has been ravaged by climatic disaster when your enclave of survivors is suddenly attacked by unknown machines.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a survivor, you must focus on collecting resources and transforming existing machines into multifunctional weapons of destruction. You are the last line of defense.\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control a warship with a variety of different skills &amp; abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Actions require resources: acquire them to upgrade your ship and build defenses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical depth: lure out enemy forces, work with allies to overcome the odds, and utilize abilities in unique ways to conquer your foes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Control a Heavy Warship</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your humble spaceship is the key to your success. Customize and upgrade your ship by completing missions, collecting resources, and defeating enemies.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Master the Battlefield</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Display your tactical brilliance and experiment with different approaches to overcome challenging foes and complete missions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Defeat is Just An Opportunity to Become Stronger</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will not survive every encounter. But with new tactical approaches and upgraded abilities, you can - and must - overcome them.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Artificial intelligence has been used for:</strong></u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some character portraits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game logo</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Uncover tactical depth and a variety of possibilities!</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779380/extras/2b6528cb165b800c00353da1a76f330c.poster.avif?t=1741951569\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779380/extras/2b6528cb165b800c00353da1a76f330c.webm?t=1741951569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779380/extras/2b6528cb165b800c00353da1a76f330c.mp4?t=1741951569\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earth has been ravaged by climatic disaster when your enclave of survivors is suddenly attacked by unknown machines.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a survivor, you must focus on collecting resources and transforming existing machines into multifunctional weapons of destruction. You are the last line of defense.\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control a warship with a variety of different skills &amp; abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Actions require resources: acquire them to upgrade your ship and build defenses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical depth: lure out enemy forces, work with allies to overcome the odds, and utilize abilities in unique ways to conquer your foes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Control a Heavy Warship</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your humble spaceship is the key to your success. Customize and upgrade your ship by completing missions, collecting resources, and defeating enemies.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Master the Battlefield</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Display your tactical brilliance and experiment with different approaches to overcome challenging foes and complete missions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Defeat is Just An Opportunity to Become Stronger</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will not survive every encounter. But with new tactical approaches and upgraded abilities, you can - and must - overcome them.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Artificial intelligence has been used for:</strong></u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some character portraits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game logo</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Uncover tactical depth and a variety of possibilities!</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779380/extras/2b6528cb165b800c00353da1a76f330c.poster.avif?t=1741951569\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779380/extras/2b6528cb165b800c00353da1a76f330c.webm?t=1741951569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779380/extras/2b6528cb165b800c00353da1a76f330c.mp4?t=1741951569\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
